==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|fullr|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|fullaz|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfʏtlʏr/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ʏtlʏr|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj-01|full|fullt|fyllri|fyllstur}}

# [[full]] of something{{jump|is|full|s}}
#: ''Salurinn var '''fullur''' af fólki.''
#:: The hall was '''full''' of people.
# [[drunk]]
#: ''Ég er svo fokking '''fullur'''!''
#:: I'm so fucking drunk!

